    "name": "Ultimate Pain",
    "steam_appid": 3396430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ultimate Pain</i> is  an experience designed to challenge your spirit, your reflexes, and your ability to <strong>not throw</strong> your controller through the nearest wall. You will jump. You will fall. You will scream. But if you rise to the challenge, an unimaginably awesome reward awaits at the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396430/extras/aeea9c26daa690cc5bcaf8c307adff32.poster.avif?t=1736755803\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396430/extras/aeea9c26daa690cc5bcaf8c307adff32.webm?t=1736755803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396430/extras/aeea9c26daa690cc5bcaf8c307adff32.mp4?t=1736755803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay That Will Ruin Your Day (and You\u2019ll Love It)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump with Purpose\u2026 and Fear</strong><br>Master the sacred art of jumping. A flawless leap is your only ally; gravity is your worst enemy. One mistake and you\u2019ll plummet back to square one like a meteor of shame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bottom Loves You</strong><br>Make friends with the starting line\u2014it\u2019s probably where you\u2019ll spend most of your time. But hey, each fall is a learning opportunity, right? (Or so they say.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress or Perish</strong><br>There\u2019s no halfway. No checkpoints. No handholding. Just you, your courage, and a bottomless pit of regret waiting to embrace you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396430/extras/cfb30eb8e2fd1f3caddfbae62edeaca1.poster.avif?t=1736755803\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396430/extras/cfb30eb8e2fd1f3caddfbae62edeaca1.webm?t=1736755803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396430/extras/cfb30eb8e2fd1f3caddfbae62edeaca1.mp4?t=1736755803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Would You Do This to Yourself?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the Agony, Chase the Ecstasy</strong><br>Every hard-earned inch upward is a triumph, every tumble downward a tragedy. It\u2019s a poetic symphony of pain and persistence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Coolest Reward Ever\u2122</strong><br>At the summit, the most epic, jaw-droppingly cool prize known to humankind awaits. What is it? You\u2019ll have to survive <i>UP</i> to find out. (Spoiler: It\u2019s worth it.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Drama</strong><br>With each jump, you\u2019ll hold your breath. With each fall, you\u2019ll lose your mind. And with each climb back up, you\u2019ll discover the indomitable spirit that defines you. Or\u2026 not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396430/extras/c9faa1ab7a636b34495db04091369708.poster.avif?t=1736755803\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396430/extras/c9faa1ab7a636b34495db04091369708.webm?t=1736755803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396430/extras/c9faa1ab7a636b34495db04091369708.mp4?t=1736755803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmosphere Designed to Mock You</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics That\u2019ll Make You Say \u201cWhy Am I Here?\u201d</strong><br>Each level is meticulously crafted to be both beautiful and rage-inducing, a cruel joke wrapped in stunning art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Soundtrack to Soothe and Torment</strong><br>Relaxing melodies lull you into a false sense of security, only to leave you alone with the sound of your own despair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Full of Sass and Secrets</strong><br>Marvel at the quirky obstacles and cryptic messages left behind to remind you that <i>yes</i>, this game is laughing at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396430/extras/9f9d5ddd23acad5197370a2372917181.poster.avif?t=1736755803\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396430/extras/9f9d5ddd23acad5197370a2372917181.webm?t=1736755803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396430/extras/9f9d5ddd23acad5197370a2372917181.mp4?t=1736755803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer's Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ultimate Pain</i> is a game born from the twisted depths of inspiration from <i>Getting Over It and Difficult game about climbing</i>. It\u2019s a love letter to suffering and an ode to perseverance. This is not for the weak, the impatient, or the sane. But for those who dare to climb, <i>UP</i> offers something few games can\u2014a chance to achieve the impossible and come out the other side stronger (and possibly more unhinged).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do You Have What It Takes?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump. Fall. Cry. Repeat. Ultimate<i>\u00a0Pain</i> isn\u2019t just a game; it\u2019s your Everest. Now climb, you magnificent fool. Victory\u2014or insanity\u2014awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396430/extras/a5b4171f3ac94ede446fd799c102b7e3.poster.avif?t=1736755803\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396430/extras/a5b4171f3ac94ede446fd799c102b7e3.webm?t=1736755803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396430/extras/a5b4171f3ac94ede446fd799c102b7e3.mp4?t=1736755803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
